Package: APCinteraction
Type: Package
Title: All Possible Comparisons (APC) Nonparametric Tests for Interaction in Balanced Two-way ANOVA Models
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Bao Khue", "Tran", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "baokhuetran@outlook.com"),
    person("Andrew", "Nguyen", role = c("aut", "ctb")),
    person("Amy", "Wagaman", role = "ctb"),
    person("Bradley", "Hartlaub", role = "ctb"),
    person("David", "Jacobson", role = "ctb"))
Description: Provides novel nonparametric tests, APCSSA and APCSSM, for interaction in two-way ANOVA designs with balanced replications using all possible comparisons. These statistics extend previous methods, allow greater flexibility, and demonstrate higher power in detecting interactions for non-normal data. In addition, the package provides intuitive and optimized functions for generating these test statistics' null distributions. 
